 "offset_seconds": -3.1200000000001893,
 "words_heard": 262,
 "words": 262,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "The king set up a golden image high upon the plain",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 1.1,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "When the music played the nations bowed, they bowed and bowed again",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 1.37,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "But three young men stood upright when the horn began to sound",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 1.46,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Shadrach, Meshach, and Abednego would not bow down",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 2.02,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Our God whom we serve is able to deliver us from the blazing furnace",
   "heard": 14,
   "words": 14,
   "error_s": 3.08,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "And he will deliver us from your hand, O king",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 3.25,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "But if not, know this, O king",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 4.15,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "We will not serve your gods",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 4.24,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "And we will not worship the golden image you have set up",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 5.98,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Seven times hotter roared the fire, the king was full of rage",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 8.37,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "They bound them in their robes and turbans, threw them in the blaze",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 4.93,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "The flames leapt out and killed the guards who brought them to the door",
   "heard": 14,
   "words": 14,
   "error_s": 5.16,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "But the king rose up astonished at the sight he saw once more",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 5.12,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Did we not throw three men, bound, into the fire",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 6.24,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "I see four men, unbound, walking around in the middle of the fire",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 8.96,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "And the fourth looks like a son of the gods",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 9.68,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Not a hair of their heads was singed",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 10.39,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "No smell of fire clung to them",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 11.22,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Our God whom we serve is able to deliver us from the blazing furnace",
   "heard": 14,
   "words": 14,
   "error_s": 15.18,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "And he will deliver us from your hand, O king",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 9.52,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "But if not, know this, O king",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 9.82,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "We will not serve your gods",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 10.33,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "And we will not worship the golden image you have set up",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 13.27,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Blessed be the God of Shadrach, Meshach, and Abednego",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 16.84,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Who sent his angel and rescued his servants who trusted in him",
   "heard": 12,
